<main class="pc" data-product-core="potential"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 03 / Potential</p><h1>Zero non è l’obiettivo.</h1><p class="pc-lead">Il potenziale si esplora individualmente, non si calcola dalla differenza.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/" aria-current="page">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>Soddisfazione personale: 0 = nessuna, 10 = completa. Scala non clinica.</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Fisico</p><h3>Movimento e comfort</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-0">Attuale</label><select id="pc-current-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Non valutato</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-0">Desiderato</label><select id="pc-desired-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Non valutato</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potenziale</span><div class="pc-unknown">Non determinato</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Cognitivo</p><h3>Attenzione</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-1">Attuale</label><select id="pc-current-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Non valutato</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-1">Desiderato</label><select id="pc-desired-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Non valutato</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potenziale</span><div class="pc-unknown">Non determinato</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Emotivo</p><h3>Calma e facilità</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-2">Attuale</label><select id="pc-current-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Non valutato</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-2">Desiderato</label><select id="pc-desired-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Non valutato</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potenziale</span><div class="pc-unknown">Non determinato</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Professionale</p><h3>Risorse nel lavoro</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-3">Attuale</label><select id="pc-current-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Non valutato</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-3">Desiderato</label><select id="pc-desired-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Non valutato</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potenziale</span><div class="pc-unknown">Non determinato</div></div></div></div></div><p class="pc-note">Il potenziale si esplora individualmente, non si calcola dalla differenza.</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>Ripristina</button><button type="button" data-save data-js hidden>Salva sul dispositivo</button></div><p class="pc-note">Nessun invio automatico; esportazione JSON locale.</p></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">Parla della tua situazione</a></div></section></main>